            "normalized_html": "<p>The double-angle formula \n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\sin{2x}=2\\sin{x}\\cos{x}]</span>\ncan be used to simplify complicated trigonometric expressions. For instance, suppose we want to simplify the expression </p>",
