          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: (\\sin 2x)/(2\\cos^{2} x)|= (2\\sin x\\cos x)/(2\\cos x\\cos x); = (2\\cos x \u22c5 \\sin x)/(2\\cos x \u22c5 \\cos x); = (\\sin x)/(\\cos x); = \\tan x]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: (\\sin 2x)/(2\\cos^{2} x)|= (2\\sin x\\cos x)/(2\\cos x\\cos x); = (2\\cos x \u22c5 \\sin x)/(2\\cos x \u22c5 \\cos x); = (\\sin x)/(\\cos x); = \\tan x]",
