        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Content:\nThe double-angle formula\n[MATH: \\sin{2x}=2\\sin{x}\\cos{x}]\ncan be used to simplify complicated trigonometric expressions. For instance, suppose we want to simplify the expression\n\nContent:\n[MATH: \\dfrac{\\sin{2x}}{2\\cos^2{x}}.]\n\nContent:\nUsing the double-angle formula, we can simplify the given expression, as follows:\n\nContent:\n[MATH: (\\sin 2x)/(2\\cos^{2} x)|= (2\\sin x\\cos x)/(2\\cos x\\cos x); = (2\\cos x \u22c5 \\sin x)/(2\\cos x \u22c5 \\cos x); = (\\sin x)/(\\cos x); = \\tan x]"
      },
